{
  "_pii_shield_note": "PII-Shield (gregmos/PII-Shield) anonymizes content before it reaches Claude. Install manually: Settings > Extensions > drag in the .mcpb file. See https://github.com/Moon-Knight13/claude_template_repo/blob/main/docs/TEMPLATE_GUIDE.md#pii--privacy-controls for details.",
  "_statusline_note": "The caveman statusline badge is auto-configured by scripts/install-caveman.sh at container start into user-level settings (~/.claude/settings.json), because the plugin script lives at a hash-versioned cache path. Do not hardcode a statusLine here."
}
